his  did chapter 1000 live up to the hype for  you or were you disappointed by chapter  1000  we didn't get a new gear or new crazy  reveals but i don't think we needed that  what this chapter was about was a  reminding us about what the story is  about  luffy becoming the pirate king and b  showing us how far he's come  since he first got that straw hat from  shanks in chapter 1.  it wasn't the climax of this arc as many  probably expected it to be  but rather it was setting the stage for  the climax of this arc  which is now clearly within sight i'm  happy with i gotta say and although some  of you in the comments expected the rox  pirates flashback  i think the right move was naming and  focusing the chapter on straw hat luffy  because that is what this series has  always been about at its core  by the way rock the name of luffy's new  attack is referencing a huge  mythical bird that was present in  stories about sinbad and other stories  so you gotta love how oda continues to  incorporate all of these  pirate and mythical elements into his  story in his unique ways  this symbolizes how no mythical devil  fruit user is above luffy  and it also represents freedom the  biggest theme in one piece  birds always represent freedom because  they unlike us humans  are not grounded to the earth  historically in the eyes of humans birds  do not follow the rules and are free to  go anywhere and what  birds more free than this giant and  legendary bird of prey  known as the rock it's the perfect name  for luffy's attack  everything came together in this chapter  including how luffy is pretty much  goldie roger like the parallel between  them could not be  stronger and as such it seems clear that  luffy like roger  is destined to become the next pirate  king and that is it for this one  you can drop your theories of what you  expect to happen next in the comments  thank you for watching and sharing this  historical moment where one piece hit a  four  digit chapter number with me we are  definitely blessed for getting to  experience this amazing tale together  week by week  if you did enjoy this review and want to  keep them coming the best thing you  could do is smash that like button like  luffy smash kaido's face  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell  join the nakama and make sure you select  all or you will miss  future one piece videos make this the  day you subscribe if you haven't already  and while you wait for the next chapter  to drop feel free to check out my  growing one piece playlist where i got  videos about the supernova  warlords the yonko and much much more  link to that is in the description and i  especially want to thank the patron  squad over on patreon and here on  youtube who helped make videos like this  one possible  first and foremost i want to thank the  patron of legend the one acknowledged by  lord tuigo himself  and the most donated champion of the  world alpha sigma  and or the one tier patrons the ones who  stand atop all clans in grata the world  acquire respect liam thompson  pate heffarethian phoenix anime 987  emperor otaku thomas jones spidey life  tinel  baked buddhist tungsten tarkis and denki  kaminari and our pro hero tier patrons  the one and only gilgamesh  steelers angel crews anatoly kazowski  cricket xp  joe stanton very gucci jessica kayla  font alicia actor bonnie parks hinokami  and water the red-haired raven florian  joanne garcia jack watches anime fat boy  games manwa freaks  deadly saint matthew cruz and anthony  schreiber thank you all  so much if you do enjoy our work you can  support more of it by going over to  patreon.com  anime uproar and becoming a patron today  for as little as one dollar  if you do so you'll get your name  featured in future videos alongside  these amazing people  right here and you'll even get access to  our private patron only discord where we  talk about anime life and of course  thank memes so check out patreon.com  anime upload link in the description if  you're interested you can also join the  youtube channel  by clicking the blue join button next to  the subscribe button that you've  hopefully already destroyed so yeah you  can support more content that way if you  prefer  whichever way you choose to support us  you can get the same great benefits  thanks again and until next time see ya  space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

